# 3. AI Course Concept Studio

Core feature

This is one of the most important areas of the application.

Allow users to describe a golf course they want to create using natural language.

Example:

"Create an 18-hole championship golf course woven through abandoned rice paddies, dense rainforest and ancient stone ruins, with elevated greens, natural streams and dramatic mountain backdrops."

The AI should interpret the description and produce a comprehensive course concept.

