## My additional recommendation

I would make the AI Course Concept Studio, Interactive Masterplan Designer and LiDAR & Terrain Processing Studio the three defining features of this application.

Together, these would address three different problems:

- What do I want my course to look like? AI concepts and environment generation.
- Where should everything go? Interactive architectural planning.
- How do I recreate the actual landscape? LiDAR and terrain processing.

One particularly valuable enhancement would be to develop a visual course-to-game construction system: select any feature on the masterplan, such as a green, bunker or fairway, and the application automatically produces a corresponding construction guide, reference image and checklist for recreating that feature in PGA TOUR 2K25.

That would make the software considerably more useful than simply being an AI image generator or a conventional golf course planning tool.